{"at":"2026-02-16T23:56:44.371Z","userId":"admin","page":{"id":163,"status":"published","language":"en","path":"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/mls-user-manual/mls-user-preferences/","title":"PropertyList MLS user preferences","description":"Here you can change your password and your platform language. Changing your Password & Platform Language Click your Name at the top right of the desktop where you will see a dropdown.Click \"Account Settings\"Here you can easily change your platform/site language and your password. Notification Settings Stay informed about important events and updates by setting","body":"<div class=\"doc-post-content \" id=\"post\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"shortcode_title\"><h1>PropertyList MLS user preferences</h1>\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ezd-meta dot-sep\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"read-time\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tEstimated reading: 2 minutes\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"views sep\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t785 views\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"ezd-meta dot-sep\"><span class=\"views sep\"><br></span></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"doc-scrollable editor-content\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"doc-content-wrap\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"9394\" class=\"elementor elementor-9394\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fa03c4d e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"fa03c4d\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-65d3f58 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"65d3f58\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:283\">Here you can change your password and your platform language.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bec92fe e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"bec92fe\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8247976 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"8247976\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Changing your Password &amp; Platform Language</h3>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-44d9399 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"44d9399\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul><li>Click your Name at the top right of the desktop where you will see a dropdown.</li><li>Click “Account Settings”</li><li>Here you can easily change your platform/site language and your password.</li></ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bdcb3bf elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"bdcb3bf\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Notification Settings</h3>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-49d9b4a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"49d9b4a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-sourcepos=\"19:1-19:117\">Stay informed about important events and updates by setting up notification preferences. Configure notifications for:</p><ul data-sourcepos=\"21:1-24:0\"><li data-sourcepos=\"21:1-21:89\">Calendar Event notifications: Stay upto-date with the latest events you have in the coming week.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"21:1-21:89\">Account Summary notifications: Keep an eye on your trends and what the office and staff are acheiving.</li></ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d4761c7 elementor-hidden-desktop elementor-hidden-tablet elementor-hidden-mobile elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"d4761c7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Tailor Communication Preferences:</h3>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bc8a147 elementor-hidden-desktop elementor-hidden-tablet elementor-hidden-mobile elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"bc8a147\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-sourcepos=\"27:1-27:87\">Choose how you want to receive communications from the PropertyList.es MLS platform. Set preferences for:</p><ul data-sourcepos=\"29:1-32:0\"><li data-sourcepos=\"29:1-29:83\">Email Notifications:&nbsp;Opt in or out of email notifications for various activities.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"30:1-30:78\">SMS Alerts:&nbsp;Choose to receive SMS alerts for important updates or reminders.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"31:1-32:0\">In-App Notifications: In-app notifications for real-time updates is always enabled.</li></ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-01abf3a elementor-hidden-desktop elementor-hidden-tablet elementor-hidden-mobile elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"01abf3a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Configure Listing Preferences:\n</h3>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d59330e elementor-hidden-desktop elementor-hidden-tablet elementor-hidden-mobile elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d59330e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Here you can set which agencies can or cannot see and share your properties.</p><p data-sourcepos=\"35:1-35:100\">You can do this with each individual property or sitewide (all of your agency properties)</p><p data-sourcepos=\"35:1-35:100\"><strong>INDIVIDUAL PROPERTY:</strong></p><ul><li data-sourcepos=\"35:1-35:100\"><strong>Open the Property you wish to configure.</strong></li><li data-sourcepos=\"35:1-35:100\"><strong>Click =&gt; “EDIT” =&gt; “ADMIN”</strong></li><li data-sourcepos=\"35:1-35:100\"><strong>Here you will see a checkbox to “Share with other agencies”</strong><strong style=\"text-align: var(--text-align); color: var(--p_color); letter-spacing: 0.15px;\">&nbsp;</strong></li></ul><p data-sourcepos=\"35:1-35:100\"><strong>ALL PROPERTIES:</strong></p><ul><li data-sourcepos=\"35:1-35:100\">&nbsp;</li></ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1ad1860 elementor-hidden-desktop elementor-hidden-tablet elementor-hidden-mobile elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"1ad1860\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Manage Lead Preferences:</h3>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-85280d9 elementor-hidden-desktop elementor-hidden-tablet elementor-hidden-mobile elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"85280d9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul><li data-sourcepos=\"43:1-43:100\"><p data-sourcepos=\"43:1-43:100\">Personalise how leads are handled and organised within the MLS system. This may include options for:</p><ul data-sourcepos=\"45:1-48:0\"><li data-sourcepos=\"46:1-46:109\">Lead Assignment Rules:&nbsp;Assign leads automatically to specific agents or teams based on predetermined rules.</li><li data-sourcepos=\"47:1-48:0\">Lead Follow-up Reminders:&nbsp;Receive reminders to follow up with leads within specified timeframes.</li></ul></li></ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-18c7205 elementor-hidden-desktop elementor-hidden-tablet elementor-hidden-mobile elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"18c7205\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Optimise Calendar Settings: -coming soon</h3></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"doc-btm\">\n\t\t    </div>","seo_title":"PropertyList MLS user preferences • PropertyList Info Hub","seo_description":"Here you can change your password and your platform language. Changing your Password & Platform Language Click your Name at the top right of the desktop where you will see a dropdown.Click \"Account Settings\"Here you can easily change your platform/site language and your password. Notification Settings Stay informed about important events and updates by setting"}}